<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <actionCalls>
        <name>Submeter_Aprovacao</name>
        <label>Submeter para Aprovacao</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>276</locationY>
        <actionName>submit</actionName>
        <actionType>submit</actionType>
        <flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>objectId</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <nameSegment>submit</nameSegment>
    </actionCalls>
    <apiVersion>66.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <description>SinalCabo (M.2) - auto-submissao ao Approval Process SC_G2_Aprovacao quando o motor marca Requer_Aprovacao = true. Record-triggered after-save; so dispara na transicao para true e quando ainda nao esta em aprovacao (Approval_Status nao e Aguarda L1/L2). Guarda defensiva: so submete se Aprovador_Alvo_N1__c estiver preenchido, para nao rebentar (erro duro do AP / ENTITY_IS_LOCKED) em opps que entrem em Requer=true+status em branco SEM aprovador calculado (migracao/integracao/edicao directa fora do motor). Nos caminhos bons o motor grava Requer=true e Aprovador_Alvo_N1 no mesmo DML, logo a condicao continua satisfeita. Torna o AP testavel end-to-end sem accao manual; o M.4 integra no pipeline.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>SC AutoSubmit Aprovacao {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>SC - AutoSubmit Aprovacao</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Submeter_Aprovacao</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
        <filterFormula>{!$Record.Requer_Aprovacao__c} = true &amp;&amp; ISBLANK(TEXT({!$Record.Approval_Status__c})) &amp;&amp; NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Aprovador_Alvo_N1__c}))</filterFormula>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
        <recordTriggerType>CreateAndUpdate</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
